    "descriptionEn": "Nearly five hectares of farmland has been processed into a sunflower farm. The farm attracts many local people from Kampong Cham and Tbong Khmum provinces to visit every day. On weekends, there are more people come enjoy the view, relax and photo shoot to post on social media. The farm’s owner said that, in the past, he planted a small number of sunflowers seedlings, but presently, since the increase numbers of tourists, he has expanded the area of farm and set up more kiosks to sit and relax. There are also more trails of vegetable plantation where tourist can sit below to stay in shade during dry season. He urges visitors not to throw rubbish in the area, and keep the environment clean and beautiful. The bee breed is also available for who are interested in breeding it in farm.",
