    "descriptionEn": "Unlike the boiling water of Kampong Speu, here is a recreation area where the water of the Kamrieng River flows and touches the rocks at the bottom of the river, creating a spectacular view of the boiling water, which is why it is 'calls Kamrieng. The water level is likely to be similar at Pich Chenda Holiday Resort, especially during the dry season. Stung Kamrieng has mountain springs which create a beautiful landscape for tourists to bathe.",
