    "descriptionEn": "This station has legends related to the history of Phnom Banan, Phnom Sampov and the mountains in this region. This natural cave has a concrete staircase and a railing up to the mouth of the cave. Phnom Romsay Sak at a cave at the mouth of the cave with a statue to pray for peace. One can enter the cave by the stairs and in this cave it is dark and cold. In addition, there are provisions to put lights in the cave, the entrance of the cave and in the pagoda to shine during various festivals. At the foot of the mountain, there is a church and a large pagoda courtyard, a garden and a well-organized road.",
