    "descriptionEn": "This station has legends related to the history of Phnom Banan, Phnom Sampov and the mountains in this region. Near this natural cave, there is also a nose lake and a tail lake, as well as a beautiful natural forest that grows on the top of the mountain. This crocodile cave is easy for tourists to visit as it is only 4-5 meters from the foot of the mountain. The cave has fresh air, a large cool yard and large rocks for relaxation. In particular, there is a staircase at the top of the mountain with a church at the top of the mountain. From there we can breathe fresh air and enjoy the beautiful scenery around Crocodile Mountain.",
